{
 "id": 1806717,
 "titulo": "1/30 Patch Details (Completed)",
 "fecha": 1706598013727,
 "modificada": 1760811006408,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1806717",
 "html": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1706575788194\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/2185a224ef5f44c5a942b49a3cf6769a_1706575788194_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Greetings, Agents.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">This is CM Fragment of MARVEL Future Fight.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">In this latest Patch,&nbsp;<br>\nmeet the Mutants who have transformed into&nbsp;<br>\na genius of transformation and the embodiment of rage.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Mystique</span>, with her new Uniform and Tier-4 Advancement,<br>\nwill skillfully accomplish missions utilizing her transformative abilities.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">And <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Madelyne Pryor</span>,&nbsp;<br>\nthe Mutant clone - filled with hatred and anger,<br>\nhas also received Tier-4 Advancement.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Agents, check out the new skills and power of the updated heroes<br>\nby downloading the 1/30 Patch!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">■ 1/30 Patch Details</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Patch Schedule: 1/31 (Wed) 3:00 (UTC+0), 1/30 (Tue) 19:00 (PST)</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">[1/31 (Wed) 3:00&nbsp;(UTC+0), 1/30 (Tue) 19:00 (PST) added]</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">The patch has been completed as of&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">1/31 (Wed) 3:00 (UTC+0), 1/30 (Tue) 19:00 (PST).</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Please reconnect to the game and download the patch file.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The patch completion time may be changed depending on the circumstances&nbsp;<br>\nand the </span><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">completion time will be announced once the patch has been completed</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">.<br>\n* The patch will be applied in waves, so the application time may vary by Agent.<br>\n* The game can still be accessed during the patch.<br>\nWhen the patch is complete, please restart and apply the patch for better service.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ One New Uniform</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">One new Uniform Mystique &lt;Hellfire Gala&gt; has been added.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">* The new Uniform can be purchased after the 1/30 Patch data has been applied.<br>\n* The new Uniform can be found and purchased at the Marvel Universe and the Uniform Room.<br>\n* The skill effects are based on Lv.10 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1706575973933\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/4b96b7d0547042b987c4de704ab57ea1_1706575973933_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Mystique, Madelyne Pryor Tier-4</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Mystique, a professional in espionage activities through transformation,<br>\nand Madelyne Pryor, a powerful being capable of harnessing the dimensional power of Limbo,<br>\nhave both newly received Tier-4 Advancement.&nbsp;<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The skill effects are based on Lv.6 stats.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1706576016749\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/b611e610135149c084fa0738a43ade3f_1706576016749_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1706576024085\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/0b80ee58151142f79e41e347fa26074d_1706576024085_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ New Artifact</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">A new Artifact for Mystique has been added.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The effects are based on the 6★ Artifact passive skill Lv.4 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1706576060528\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/fda0eba82b9c455dbd234ee20a940d00_1706576060528_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Game Error Fixes</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. The mission being incorrectly displayed in&nbsp;<br>\nEpic Quest &lt;Goblin Queen&gt;: Story [Total Havok] has been fixed.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">- Before:<br>\n[Brothers in Danger] Clear Fabricated Will 5 times</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">- After:<br>\n[Brother in Crisis] Clear Manipulated Will 5 times</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">2. The name of Jean Grey in the Hero Bio section of Madelyne Pryor has been fixed.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">We look forward to your active participation in the events&nbsp;<br>\nthat will be held to support the growth of the updated heroes.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Thank you.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1706575803679\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/adb48f2a92f549448fe210ad3e5d2d36_1706575803679_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n"
}